ar near active volcanoes. Veins of water under the ground are heated by magma to well up as hot springs."]},{"at":[5,8],"source_script":"LavaridgeTown_EventScript_OldMan","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_OLD_MAN","source_id":3,"local_id":3,"source_local":"","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["Being buried in this hot sand is… Sigh…\nSo warm and heavenly…\nEh? Gyaah! Ouch!\nA POKéMON nipped my backside!"]},{"at":[10,13],"source_script":"LavaridgeTown_EventScript_Twin","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_TWIN","source_id":4,"local_id":4,"source_local":"","facing":"down","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_WANDER_UP_AND_DOWN","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["I bathe in the hot springs every day.\nI want to become a beautiful and strong GYM LEADER like FLANNERY."]},{"at":[4,4],"source_script":"LavaridgeTown_EventScript_HotSpringsOldWoman1","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_HOT_SPRINGS_OLD_WOMAN","source_id":5,"local_id":5,"source_local":"","facing":"right","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN_AND_RIGHT","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["If people put POKéMON in hot springs, it might be seriously strange.\nWhy, it might be an electric bath, or a bubble bath, or even a lava bath…"]},{"at":[5,4],"source_script":"LavaridgeTown_EventScript_HotSpringsOldWoman2","source_flag":"0","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_HOT_SPRINGS_OLD_WOMAN","source_id":6,"local_id":6,"source_local":"","facing":"left","movement":"MOVEMENT_TYPE_FACE_DOWN_AND_LEFT","elevation":3,"initially_hidden":false,"name":"居民","lines":["They're claiming that these hot springs are good for calming nervous tension, relieving aching muscles, solving romantic problems, and attracting money…"]},{"at":[6,16],"source_script":"0x0","source_flag":"FLAG_HIDE_LAVARIDGE_TOWN_RIVAL_ON_BIKE","source_gfx":"OBJ_EVENT_GFX_VAR_3","source_id":7,"local_id":7,"source_local":"LOCALID_LA